percolator-ts
A port of Percolator v16 to TypeScript, compiled to a Solana SBF program with TypeSOL.

This is a derived work of Percolator by Anatoly Yakovenko, Copyright Anatoly Yakovenko, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (the text is in LICENSE, copied from the upstream repository at the commit below):

- aeyakovenko/percolator-prog, commit 7b11091328de23cded2e4afe96592bbd060a6828 (the Solana program,
  src/v16_program.rs, default features)
- aeyakovenko/percolator, commit 5e3af0710ec7e9b7077393012f8a94a31b2f07ef (the risk engine, src/v16.rs and
  src/wide_math.rs, the commit fixed by the program's Cargo.lock)

Changes: the program and the engine code its 50 instructions reach were rewritten in TypeScript for the TypeSOL
compiler (src/). The files under reference/ build the upstream sources unchanged and run the upstream test suite;
reference/trace/*.rs are replacements spliced, only for tracing, into LiteSVM 0.1.0, solana-sdk 1.18.26 and
solana-program 1.18.26 (each Apache-2.0) inside the test container.

This port is unofficial: it is not made, reviewed or endorsed by the upstream author. The upstream warning applies to
it equally: an educational research project, not audited, not for use in production or with real funds.

The comparison also uses, unchanged and built from source in Docker: aeyakovenko/percolator-match, commit
60aac3a996d0264c47fbefe9a2625d6ee6fb6a47, and the test matchers in percolator-prog's tests/fixtures (Apache-2.0).

A binary built from src/ contains the TypeSOL runtime of the @typesol/cli package (MIT licence), which the compiler
links into every program.
